      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We studied the additive effect of ticlopidine to aspirin compared with aspirin in the prevention of thrombus formation after PTCA in two groups of 21 patients who underwent PTCA at Her Majesty's Cardiac Centre, Siriraj Hospital from January to April 1993. Patients in both groups were comparable in baseline patient data and characteristics of angiographic lesions. There was no difference in angiographic outcome including the presence of intracoronary thrombus between the two groups. We concluded that ticlopidine had no additive effect to aspirin in the prevention of thrombus formation after PTCA."},
